  "prefLabel": "He-P 311.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 311.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to set forth the requirements to establish and operate temporary acute care centers located within a hospital pursuant to RSA 141-C:26, and thereby ensure, through basic standards, the health and safety of individuals in a temporary acute care center located within a hospital.\n\nSource. #13304, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 12-10-21; ss by #13380-A, eff 5-25-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p300.html"
